# Copy to .env.local. Both are optional — the site works with neither set.

# Where the enquiry form POSTs its JSON. Formspree, Basin, a Worker, anything
# that accepts a POST. Unset, the form composes a prefilled mail draft instead,
# so an expired key degrades to something that still reaches a human.
VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=

# Your own endpoint for rephrasing assistant answers. Retrieval still runs in
# the browser and still decides the grounding; this only improves the prose.
#
# NEVER put a model provider key here. Anything prefixed VITE_ is compiled into
# the client bundle and is readable by every visitor. The browser calls this
# endpoint; this endpoint calls the provider with the key held server-side.
VITE_ASSISTANT_ENDPOINT=
